1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,240
Their demand to use Lu Quang for trade must be a part of Chen Zhen's trap.

2
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:09,440
Only two people can go in.

3
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:12,500
You and...

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,040
Zhao Ling.

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:14,120
Right.

6
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:15,420
I'm in.

7
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:18,960
Slow down.

8
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,280
Be smart.

9
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:21,580
We'll think of another way.

10
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,320
There's no time to argue.

11
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:24,440
Let's go.

12
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,380
Plan on the drive.

13
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,120
She could be another set of eyes for us.

14
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:36,560
You're very brave to help.

15
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:37,720
I've got an idea.

16
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:42,140
He said I need to be there, but not which one.

17
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,120
What are you getting at?

18
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:49,220
I'll enter a photo captured by one of the station surveillance cameras.

19
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,680
Then we send that me to the exchange.

20
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:56,300
We make the trade and wait until Lu Quang is safe.

21
00:00:56,920 --> 00:00:58,200
Then I get out of there.

22
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,740
I'll show up where the photo was taken, and when we're in the clear, I'll rejoin you.

23
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:09,040
Here.

24
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:11,260
This is real-time footage of the hall.

25
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:15,440
I'll be honest.

26
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:17,440
This plan of yours...

27
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:19,280
makes no damn sense.

28
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:20,540
Captain!

29
00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:21,200
Huh?

30
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:22,100
It worked!

31
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:26,480
But you were just here and...

32
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:27,120
Oh, damn.

33
00:01:27,740 --> 00:01:29,020
Not for the easy part.

34
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:30,220
You ready?

35
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,040
This theater used to be the venue for a lot of magic shows.

36
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:39,240
These trap doors were put in to accommodate the more elaborate tricks.

37
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,140
Ours will have to be equally as elaborate.

38
00:01:44,220 --> 00:01:46,020
We're dealing with a clever audience.

39
00:01:47,020 --> 00:01:48,700
We won't catch him with this.

40
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:51,320
I've dealt with him enough to know.

41
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:54,300
He'll be counting on his ability to let him escape.

42
00:01:54,980 --> 00:01:56,520
He does rely on it heavily.

43
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:59,400
Almost as if he assumes it's unbeatable.

44
00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:03,480
Plan B, then.

45
00:02:04,260 --> 00:02:06,300
It doesn't matter if he gets away.

46
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:09,640
Just as long as we know where he is.

47
00:02:09,640 --> 00:02:17,580
I'll hide a tracker in his costume and then disable the metal detector at the door

48
00:02:17,580 --> 00:02:20,940
so they can pass through our security check and be none the wiser.

49
00:02:20,940 --> 00:02:22,300
All right.

50
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:24,620
Let's see how sneaky you are.

51
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:31,920
What in the hell?

52
00:02:32,220 --> 00:02:33,620
How did he pull that off?

53
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:34,380
Huh.

54
00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:38,900
Boss, guess you were right.

55
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:41,680
He popped up somewhere else just like you said he would.

56
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:44,080
The police won't wait for long.

57
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:47,020
They'll rush in as soon as Lu Guang is secured.

58
00:02:47,820 --> 00:02:49,360
We'll need to keep them busy.

59
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:52,480
And then vanish without a trace.

60
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:56,060
So then, what to do now?

61
00:02:56,540 --> 00:02:57,840
A grand finale, perhaps?

62
00:02:58,460 --> 00:03:00,700
Something that'll bring the house down.

63
00:03:08,020 --> 00:03:08,540
Ah!

64
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:08,960
Ah!

65
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:10,780
Ah!

66
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:15,780
See them?

67
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,680
How close are they to the entrance?

